# Converted from the old Grade 2 Survex data (Grade2/Grade2/Nunnery.svx).

# > Ogof Draenen: Perseverence Series
# 
# This data represents a fairly rough compass & tape survey with
# occasional estimated clino readings.
# 
# Survey conducted on Sunday 6th November by Morgannwg Caving Club.
# Surveyed by: Kevin Munn; Liam Kealy; Ali Garman; Dave Glover
# Data entry: Tim Long

survey nunnery

# Station Equivalences

# Specify units of measurement

# Magnetic North to Grid North correction
# Mag deviation at the time of the readings (9-Oct-94) was
# 4.2 degrees (data from OS sheet 161, 1991).

# Data ordering

centreline
  # BCRA2
  sd length 0.5 metres
  sd compass clino 2.5 degrees
  calibrate compass 4.2
  data normal from to length compass clino
  2	1	5	24	0	# Large choke at end of Nunnery with impressive echo
  2	3	30.1	212	0
  3	4	28.5	200	0
  4	5	14.5	200	0	# Junction with Perseverence passage
  5	6	30	196	0
  6	7	8.3	220	0
  7	8	15.2	192	0
  8	9	7.5	218	0
  9	9-1	2.8	140	0	# Side passage 10m+
  9	10	27.4	208	0
  10	11	10.9	188	0
  11	windy	18.9	204	0	# Cairn at Windy Junction

endcentreline
endsurvey
